            "verseId": "EXO.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " abarira Mose ati: “Niwandike ibi mu gitabu, kugira ngo bize vyame vyibukwa, kandi ubimenyeshe na Yosuwa, kuko nzorandura Abamaleki ntibazosubire kwibukwa musi y’ijuru.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.17.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
